{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23367","headline":"别毡帐火炉 · 白居易","name":"别毡帐火炉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昨腊月天，北风三尺雪。\n年老不禁寒，夜长安可彻。\n赖有青毡帐，风前自张设。\n复此红火炉，雪中相暖热。\n如鱼入渊水，似兔藏深穴。\n婉软蛰鳞苏，温炖冻肌活。\n方安阴惨夕，遽变阳和节。\n无奈时候迁，岂是恩情绝。\n毳䈴逐日卷，香燎随灰灭。\n离恨属三春，佳期在十月。\n但令此身健，不作多时别。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23367.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23367","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}